      "id": "idea",
      "narration": "Pip decides, with huge enthusiasm, that he will read one whole hour every single night. He lasts about two days. Clear's answer is the two minute rule. Shrink the habit down until it is almost laughably small. Not read a book. Read a single page. Not run three miles. Just put on your shoes and step outside. Make the first step so tiny that skipping it would feel faintly ridiculous.",
